    "detailed_description": "Greetings and Salutations!<br>Welcome to the ISL (Interstellar Sports League) and the EXCITING world of Angular Velocity, the only sanctioned competitive high speed disc game! <br><br>In Angular Velocity, you and up to three other pilots are pitted against another motley crew of disc jockeys as you catch, pass, and score goals in stadiums across the civilized planets represented by the League!<br><br>Find your place amongst the stars and reach new heights of glory in Angular Velocity!!!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><br><u>Unlocks</u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Ships<br></li><li> Paint jobs<br></li><li> Bits and Bobs for your ships</li></ul><u>Game Play</u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Single Player Campaign <br></li><li> Local split screen multiplayer (up to 4 players!)<br></li><li> LAN multiplayer (up to 8 players!)<br></li><li> Online Play<br></li><li> Ranked matches (Teams or solo)</li></ul><u>Planned Updates</u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> New ships every 3 months <br></li><li> New planets / arenas</li></ul>",
